<section id="trust" class="zx-trust" aria-labelledby="zx-trust-title">
  <div class="zx-shell">
    <div class="zx-trust__headline" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div>
        <span class="zx-section-heading__eyebrow">安全与可信</span>
        <h2 id="zx-trust-title">知识可以流动，边界始终清晰</h2>
      </div>
      <p>从访问控制到答案引用，知序 AI 把安全与可信做进每一次检索，而不是事后补充。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="zx-trust__grid">
      <article data-aos="fade-up">
        <span>{% render 'icon', name: 'lock', class: 'zx-trust__icon' %}</span>
        <div><h3>原生权限继承</h3><p>同步用户、部门与空间权限，不额外制造一套难维护的授权体系。</p></div>
      </article>
      <article data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="60">
        <span>{% render 'icon', name: 'shield', class: 'zx-trust__icon' %}</span>
        <div><h3>全链路访问审计</h3><p>记录知识同步、检索与引用行为，关键操作有迹可循。</p></div>
      </article>
      <article data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="120">
        <span>{% render 'icon', name: 'circle-check', class: 'zx-trust__icon' %}</span>
        <div><h3>答案来源可验证</h3><p>保留原文位置与更新时间，用户可以快速核对重要结论。</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="zx-trust__principles" aria-label="可信原则">
      <span><strong>权限同步</strong><small>只看见被授权的知识</small></span>
      <span><strong>传输加密</strong><small>连接与调用全程保护</small></span>
      <span><strong>引用透明</strong><small>答案依据清晰可追溯</small></span>
      <span><strong>内容可控</strong><small>支持更新、停用与移除</small></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
